            "image1": "shopify://shop_images/a41.png",
            "image2": "shopify://shop_images/a42.png",
            "text": "Struggling with public speaking always, spurred by intriguing surveys, I decided to make a change in the new year by incorporating more substantial movements. Surprisingly, these small adjustments made a big difference."
