            "image1": "shopify://shop_images/a11.png",
            "image2": "shopify://shop_images/a12.png",
            "text": "I can't pinpoint when the hurtful body-shaming drove me away from the poolside I once cherished. It hit me that embracing and loving myself is the most powerful response."
