            "image1": "shopify://shop_images/a21.png",
            "image2": "shopify://shop_images/a22.png",
            "text": "Is every 30-something woman's life a constant stream of \"believe it or not\" advice, or is it just me? Time to swing my arms and smash through this noise like a tennis ball."
          }
        },
        "04d33859-9b3e-4de5-a9a1-c8ed7026cdb5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/a3_65d4f635-93e2-4320-8d10-4a8fbd5b53ca.png",
            "image1": "shopify://shop_images/a31.png",
            "image2": "shopify://shop_images/a32.png",
            "text": "No more stressing over standing out at parties or fitting in. It turns out, embracing my inner twerp who enjoys sitting in the audience and cheering is quite enjoyable. Raise your glass!"
          }
        }
      },
